Usage: ruralz bundle validate [DIR] [FLAGS]

Offline validation, source-mapped diagnostics.

Runs every offline stage of the configuration pipeline and prints each
diagnostic as one line, or with --output json as one JSON array. With
--environments and no --env it runs once per Environment of the file, in file
order. Exits 1 when a diagnostic is an error, 0 otherwise.

Arguments:
  DIR  Bundle directory, one-file Bundle, or - for standard input (default .)

Flags:
  --env NAME           Render with this Environment's overlay and variables, read from --environments
  --environments FILE  Local Environment resources
  --help               Print this help
  --online             Also check each Plugin artifact (fetching artifacts is Planned (M2))
  --output text|json   Output format (text or json, default text)
